            "verb": "TO WAIT / TO MEASURE — Dixie and Destiny are measuring the clerk, measuring the moment, holding themselves in perfect readiness",
            "bodyLanguage": "[Image3]: Plastic mask obscures most facial expression, but eyes visible through eyeholes are focused and alert. Body completely still—no weight shift, no fidgeting, no breath visible. Hands relaxed at sides, fingers not curled. Shoulders level. Legs locked. This is a teenager performing perfect stillness, which reads as unnatural control. [Image4]: Identical stillness on opposite side of aisle. Both girls appear as statues in Halloween costumes.",
            "dialogue": "none — silent shot",
            "microExpressions": [
              "[Image3] (18s mark): A single rapid eye dart from straight-ahead focus to glance at [Image4], then back to clerk. One-frame movement. Synchronization check.",
